abstract: "This theoretical work develops a gauge-covariant algorithm for estimating and correcting non-Abelian geometric holonomies in transported time-bin photonic qudit subspaces. It extends prior Abelian Pancharatnam--Berry phase feed-forward calibration from scalar bin-resolved phases to matrix-valued Wilczek--Zee holonomies, using polar-decomposed overlap matrices, consistency and stability guarantees, and reproducible Mathematica validation protocols."
